        504.0195007324219,
        218.40049743652344
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "on the output quantity of interest, rather than a crisp value. Particles are generated with an",
      "bbox": [
        107.99999237060547,
        229.43353271484375,
        504.01959228515625,
        238.3304901123047
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
