        107.99999237060547,
        249.362548828125,
        505.76300048828125,
        258.2594909667969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposal distribution is constructed by running a parallel Unscented Kalman Filter to drive",
      "bbox": [
        107.67098999023438,
        269.29156494140625,
        504.0194091796875,
        278.1885070800781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "particles in regions of high expected likelihood and achieve a high eﬀective sample size. The",
      "bbox": [
        107.99999237060547,
        289.2215576171875,
        504.01959228515625,
        298.1184997558594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "bounds are then computed by an inexpensive tuning of the importance weights via numerical",
